# Duwamish-I (UE-1000) — OBB Unseen Level -9 V-OS / C-EXEC Operations Script
# Demonstrates: Ferrite Vault C-EXEC IPL, WEAR compartment security, Tier 3b CHIO
# (Disc, 9-Track Tape READ_BACKWARD, Alexandrian Silo, Level -8 Chute), multi-CPU
# preemptive User jobs with hardware isolation, live Ashby tile cutover, and VSM audit.

WHO
CEXEC
LS ALL

# 1. Test WEAR Compartment Security: GUEST cannot read restricted SILO:WEAR_CHARTER.SEC
LOGIN GUEST
CAT SILO:OPEN_NOTES.TXT
CAT SILO:WEAR_CHARTER.SEC

# 2. Switch to University Librarian J. Ulysses Jameson (cleared for 1971 & 7777)
LOGIN JAMESON
CAT SILO:BYURAKAN_71.MEMO
STAGE SILO:WEAR_CHARTER.SEC DISC:CHARTER_COPY.TXT
CHUTE INGEST DISC:L8_SETUN70.TXT
CAT DISC:L8_SETUN70.TXT

# 3. Exercise 9-Track Ternary Tape (CHIO #2) including Setun/IBM 2401 READ_BACKWARD
TAPE WRITE "OBB-LEVEL-9 ALEXANDRIAN CHECKPOINT 1973"
TAPE READBACK
TAPE REWIND
TAPE READ

# 4. Submit 3 isolated User-mode jobs to C-EXEC (2 valid + 1 rogue trying M[-1]!)
LOGIN BROOKS
SUBMIT SUM_20 "AADD A1, A0, #20 | ADD S1, S0, #0\nLP: A2S S2, A1 | ADD S1, S1, S2\nBCT A1, #LP | NOP\nSVC #2\nSVC #1" --quantum 6
SUBMIT CLOCK_CHK "SVC #4\nSVC #2\nSVC #5\nSVC #2\nADD S1, S0, #42 | NOP\nSVC #1" --quantum 6
SUBMIT ROGUE_JOB "LD S1, -1(A0)\nSVC #1" --quantum 6
DISPATCH 2
PS
CEXEC

# 5. Live Beer VSM / Ashby <75 us hot-spare cutover drill + alarm acknowledge
FAULT TILE 7 BYURAKAN_DRILL
TILES
VSM
ACK
VSM
AUDIT
